@startuml
!define PRIMARY_COLOR #2E86AB
!define SECONDARY_COLOR #A23B72
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor PRIMARY_COLOR
  ArrowColor PRIMARY_COLOR
}
title Diagramme de composants

component "Frontend React SPA" as React
component "Auth UI" as AuthUI
component "Booking UI" as BookingUI
component "Notifications" as NotifUI
component "Dashboard" as DashboardUI

React -down- AuthUI
React -down- BookingUI
React -down- NotifUI
React -down- DashboardUI

component "API Laravel" as API
component "Controllers" as Ctrls
component "Services" as Svc
component "ORM Eloquent" as Orm

API -down- Ctrls
API -down- Svc
API -down- Orm
database "MySQL (prod)\nSQLite (dev)" as DB
component "Sanctum" as Sanctum
cloud "Google Maps Platform" as GMAPS
component "Notification Service\n(in-app)" as Notif

React --> API : Axios / REST
API --> DB : ORM queries
API --> Sanctum : auth middleware
API --> GMAPS : estimation distance/temps
API --> Notif : envoi/lecture notifications

note bottom of React
SPA avec React Router, Tailwind, polling pour notifications.
end note
@enduml
